This is an EVIDENCE-ADMISSION surface: it decides what the system is permitted to treat as
fact. It is widened by NAMING FILES on an explicit instruction, never by loosening a rule, and
the fail-closed property is preserved - a query the classifier does not recognize still
retrieves nothing and still cites nothing.

