answered from its own knowledge anyway, and the honesty guard correctly threw the answer away.
The guard was the only part of the chain working.

Root cause: `_approved_evidence_paths` held five structured-state files. The CONSTITUTION
ITSELF - 1,956 bytes stating "The Praxis Answer is the only canonical synthesis channel" - was
absent; only the small state JSON beside it was a candidate. Asked "What is the Praxis
